{"reviewId": "204884832_865bT8J3p", "review": {"abstract": "在长波走向萧条的过程中，把握第三库存周期带来的经济阶段性企稳以及价格体系的修复是进行资本市场投资的关键", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "chapterUid": 18, "content": "当大萧条还没真正到来时，市场往往先经历一段由库存周期带来的“假性复苏”。看清这段企稳背后的逻辑，就能在风险资产尚处低位时提前布局，在真正进入萧条前顺利落袋", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "21247-21298", "createTime": 1768145426, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 18, "reviewId": "204884832_865bT8J3p", "userVid": 204884832, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "13 康波体系下的黄金价格", "author": {"userVid": 204884832, "name": "看见成长", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0031-yKiYCkEAiryqYm4O5LGjZb1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-500", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 204366970, "name": "dove", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/q0CXT6RDScOPE3v2hibLb7WMYrAZknkzSwmoaPCOtPRibrTClD1aLuibbgj5ibgRcxKvTJrtrnMlVicxgzyoZAqUUTVSS4mFURzUcl75ibb0rlAto/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-2000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 2000}}], "commentsCount": 8, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "现在大萧条来了吗？", "reviewId": "204884832_86